>
> >
> > Hi Jairo
> >
> > We are using ActiLife 6,.13.4, which according to the Copyright Info is from 2009-2015. So it's quite dated...
> > And yes, some of the files are cropped or you could say, partialy exported from the Centerpoint website, since some recordings were (unnecessarily) long, so we only exported certain periods of time. I'm not sure, whether Idle-Sleep-Mode was activated. I didn't think so but maybe I'm wrong.
