which GGIR csv file? GGIR outputs the time stamp in several csv reports. Knowing in which one of them the timestamp is not as expected can help to identify the problem.

Between release 2.7-0 en 2.8-0 some specific bugs were fixed in handling the timezone in sleep diaries when working on OSx and most problematic in timezones in the far east (Australia and eastward) as it undermined recognising the date correctly.

Regarding both questions. Could you share a test example to help me investigate the issue? I would need:
Raw file
Corresponding sleep diary line.

I do not have a OSx but can test it in Windows/Linux.

Best,

Vincent

